   6:VaDist.cpp    ****  *
   7:VaDist.cpp    ****  * Knob map:
   8:VaDist.cpp    ****  *   KNOB 1 – Drive (0–5)
   9:VaDist.cpp    ****  *   KNOB 2 – Tone Control (0-1)
  10:VaDist.cpp    ****  *   KNOB 3 – Master Volume (0-1)
  11:VaDist.cpp    ****  *   KNOB 4 – Clean Blend (0 = full wet, 1 = full dry)
  12:VaDist.cpp    ****  *   KNOB 5 – --
  13:VaDist.cpp    ****  *   KNOB 6 – --
  14:VaDist.cpp    ****  *
  15:VaDist.cpp    ****  * CV In 1: Drive CV (0-5 V → 0-100)
  16:VaDist.cpp    ****  * CV In 2: Tone CV (0-5 V → 0-1)
  17:VaDist.cpp    ****  * CV In 3: Volume CV (0-5 V → 0-1)
  18:VaDist.cpp    ****  * CV In 4: Clean Blend CV (0-5 V → 0-1)
  19:VaDist.cpp    ****  *
  20:VaDist.cpp    ****  * Toggle 1: Symmetric (up) vs asymmetric (down) diode clipping.
  21:VaDist.cpp    ****  *
  22:VaDist.cpp    ****  * CV Out 1 = Envelope follower output, Left channel (0-5 V)
  23:VaDist.cpp    ****  * CV Out 2 = Envelope follower output, Right channel (0-5 V)
  24:VaDist.cpp    ****  * True stereo: IN_L → OUT_L, IN_R → OUT_R with independent simulation state.
  25:VaDist.cpp    ****  */
  26:VaDist.cpp    **** 
  27:VaDist.cpp    **** #include "daisy_patch_sm.h"
